Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a time known as\Nthe Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At times through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.05,0:01:58.39,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,981)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)\t(7359,7401,\1a&HFF&)}Arlong Park
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.05,0:01:58.39,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(978,981)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Arlong Park
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weather's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So which way is the Grand\NLine? Is it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or maybe this way that way over here maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there I don't know\Nwhere gonna be i want to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see this place i want\Nto see you need to sit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez you bug me oh sorry\Ni'm just excited that we
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally got a cook on board\Nnow we just need Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then nothing will stand\Nbetween us and the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I could just sit around all day\Nand think about how beautiful she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait till I get to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are we getting close to where Nami is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way too naive and way too young!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize every second that passes\Nbrings us closer to the infamous R-log?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami couldn't stop looking at\NArlong's picture when she saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't a normal kind of stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was something different\Nabout the way she was staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's planning on taking down Arlong and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.18,0:03:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then collecting the 20\Nmillion berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, while we just sit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's already making her\Nway through his compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you guys\Nare so clueless that you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have actually never\Nheard of the evil Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for your education on the\Ncunning shark that is Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong is a fishman who used to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everything in his path up\Nand down the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman? That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever\Nmet one of those before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that the females\Non Fishman Island are some
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the most beautiful creatures\Nin the world to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they look like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you focus for just one minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please all right. I will start\Nfrom the very beginning. The reason
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they call the Grand Line of pirate\Ngraveyard in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is because of our long and the\Nother two powers like him who rule
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over it the first of the powers\Nare known as the seven warlords
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords are pirates\Nauthorized by the government. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would any pirate on the\Nsea want government approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.22,0:04:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government looks the other way in\Nexchange for a cut of their treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're allowed to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, to other pirates,\Nthey're just government dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they didn't get to where\Nthey are by being weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who defeated Zoro\Nis one of these warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Haki Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet\Nall seven of these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sound awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, the first among the warlords,\Nat least first you should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is Jinbe, captain of the Fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is dangerous like no\None you've ever known?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easily causing as much\Nhavoc and destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around the Grand Line as Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks just like your last\Npicture, only standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong has taken control of over 20\Ntowns since coming to the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His strength easily surpasses\Nanyone you've encountered,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including that of Don Crocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do you think Nami would go\Nafter this guy all by herself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants to collect\Nthe bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wouldn't it be great\Nif Nami was a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to see that.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.44,0:06:14.56,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&HFCFEFE&}m 848 508 l 845 512 840 513 840 518 817 528 814 466 834 445 851 480
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.44,0:06:14.56,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,1)\p1\c&HF9FAFE&}m 895 501 l 896 512 896 524 896 539 920 553 921 541 920 529 919 524 919 507
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.44,0:06:14.56,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnInk Free\blur1\c&H030B0F&\fax0.839206\fscx22.15\fscy33.33\frx0.8981\fry53.7564\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\org(908.34,493.07)\pos(899.15,509.57)\frz318.8}Nami
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.56,0:06:14.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1}m 768 555 l 706 540 713 451 824 444 843 444 878 454 991 496 995 547 919 542 858 450 847 446 782 458
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.56,0:06:14.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnInk Free\blur1\c&H030B0F&\fax0.288573\fscx52.47\fscy55.10\frx0.4169\fry18.2206\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\org(961.3,493.9)\pos(953.81,521.18)\frz329.2}Nami
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.69,0:06:18.19,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1}m 709 581 l 618 581 615 468 771 443 895 433 1067 458 1072 565 963 554 867 437 744 445 708 552
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.69,0:06:18.19,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnInk Free\blur1\c&H030B0F&\fax0.000001\fscx75.00\fscy75.00\frz-24.5000\frx0.0001\fry-0.0001\xbord0.00\ybord0.00\org(999.47,495.68)\pos(999.47,532.8)}Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear that thing up or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have either of you morons heard a\Nsingle word that I've said to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, badass fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some guy's stronger than some other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never had to face a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we will when we get\Nthere, so don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll get lunch started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time. Let's eat. What? Food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you in the mood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want meat right off the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want salty bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat and bean sprouts, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, having a cook is the best! Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:06:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:06:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of meat! Sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.82,0:07:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.36,0:07:09.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,1729)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4651,4693,\1a&HFF&)}Northwestern East Blue
Dialogue: 3,0:07:03.36,0:07:09.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,1729)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Northwestern East Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's this month's take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.34,0:07:26.01,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,482)\an2\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,640)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,475,\1a&H00&)\t(5188,5230,\1a&HFF&)}{Captain Nezumi\N16th Navy Branch-OG}Captain Nezumi\N16th Branch, Marines{Z}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:20.34,0:07:26.01,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,482)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,640)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Captain Nezumi\N16th Navy Branch-OG}Captain Nezumi\N16th Branch, Marines{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Arlong, you are so much smarter than\Nyour regular run-of-the-mill pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how the world works.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.80,0:07:33.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,479)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,565)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\t(4111,4153,\1a&HFF&)}{Captain “Sawtooth” Arlong\NArlong Pirates-OG}Captain "Sawtooth" Arlong\N(Saw Shark Fishman)\NArlong Pirates{PP}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:28.80,0:07:33.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,479)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,565)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Captain “Sawtooth” Arlong\NArlong Pirates-OG}Captain "Sawtooth" Arlong\N(Saw Shark Fishman)\NArlong Pirates{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Likewise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there aren't many marine captains\Nwho know that befriending
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me means they can milk the\NEast Blue for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you understand makes you more\Nlike me than any other marine out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me. Thank money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing you\Ncan count on in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more reliable than\Npeople, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a rule, I hate all humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you are the one tolerable\Nexception that I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not stay a while and\Nhave a drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would, but the longer a marine\Ncruiser stays docked at a pirate island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the quicker we get unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill anyone who reports you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but still, we must go. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escort him back to his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.90,0:08:31.87,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,70)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Officer Hatchan\N(Octopus Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:08:26.90,0:08:31.87,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,70)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}Officer Hatchan\N(Octopus Fishman)\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pot's back that\Nway. Hop in. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see your face, it\Nalways makes me want to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.46,0:08:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachi, watch your mouth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's our honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fishmen are disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a vile group, but\Nthey sure do pay well.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.48,0:09:06.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}{Arlong Park East Gate-OG}East Gate, Arlong Park{PJ}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:02.48,0:09:06.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}{Arlong Park East Gate-OG}East Gate, Arlong Park{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong's going to die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed my daddy, and so now\NI'm going to have to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So move, or I'll have to kill you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should know that\NArlong doesn't have time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to deal with whimpering\Nlittle punks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too young. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that with you and use it to\Nkeep yourself out of trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, you've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you around\Nhere for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how did you do this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I can't believe the world\Nis full of such blind idiots, modesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You girl are one excellent\Nliar. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's finally returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a party!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,80)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Officer Nami\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:10:28.19,0:10:31.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,80)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}Officer Nami\NArlong Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Arlong Park. Ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Park, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:11:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the hideout of Arlong the\NFishman Pirate from the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Nomi's really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis-Nami's ship was the Going\NMary, so before we do anything stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should quietly check to see if\Nit stopped on this island first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just said we shouldn't\Ndo anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.23,0:11:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know nothing about this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys are the fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need some kind of plan to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the two of you are busy\Nblabbering and wimping out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm placing my thoughts on the\Nbattle we're about to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy told me to bring her\Nback and I'll do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Found it! The Going Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she has to be on\Nthe island somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you idiots untie me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're east of Arlong Park\Nhere at Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would she have stopped\Nso far from the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Untie me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're hurt way too bad to\Nbe of any help when we go ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rista, you can help next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of these days, I'm going to\Nskewer him like a piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will bring back the girls safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like skipping Arlong\NPark has sure cheered you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring us alongside the Going Merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we're underway, it's time\Nto give a name to this voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I shall call it the Great\NAdventures of Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.61,0:13:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie, dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't we just dock right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were three fishmen over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Arlong's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there are fishmen here, this entire\Narea must be under Arlong's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could just say we couldn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Untie me now, morons! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen that boat before. Suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, untie me! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two get back here or you're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just drifted here\Nfrom real far out or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are dead and\Nthey don't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe somebody just wanted\Nhim to die real slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should take him to our law.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.76,0:14:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will tell Luffy that you were\Ncourageous to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now let's find some land. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this place is called Gosa Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard Arlong came through here a few\Nweeks back, but I never thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard people say that\Nfishmen can be stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than normal human beings\Nby a very wide margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is how strong you have\Nto be to survive the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but even the street's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster Mama caused\Nthis destruction. Monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this place has monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We caught him out on the Grand Line\Nand brought him back here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the Grand Line, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. We...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were with that guy from the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:16:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just hold my position here and wait\Nfor our backup from Yosaku and Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a fish man, but there's\Nno way you can catch me on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a very fast runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a beautiful gazelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got you, stupid fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.10,0:16:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I'll avenge my\Nfather by killing you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.42,0:16:28.59,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an8\bord3\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(1156,575)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4692,4734,\1a&HFF&)}{Nojiko\NFrom Cocoyashi Village-OG}Nojiko\NCocoyashi Village{WF}
