Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.42,0:16:28.59,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an8\bord3\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(493,575)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4692,4734,\1a&HFF&)}{Chabo\NFrom Gosa Town-OG}Chabo\NGosa Town{WF}
Dialogue: 3,0:16:23.42,0:16:28.59,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(480,478)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx55\fscy60\pos(493,575)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}{Chabo\NFrom Gosa Town-OG}Chabo\NGosa Town{WF}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, how many times\Ndo I have to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koby, you do not mess with the fish men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just one person who\Ndecided to stand up to them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they responded by\Nslaughtering everyone in Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm, you look and smell just like a fish\Nman, but I can see that you're human,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mostly human. Not mostly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go? Over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fish man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.20,0:16:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, stand back and\Nlet me handle this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch as Captain Usa\Ntakes out this fish man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my special attack. Let's starve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he wasn't\Nlistening when I said the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fishmen would kill us\Nif we messed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, tough guy.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.26,0:17:20.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(983,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,645)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(941,983,\1a&H00&)}Outskirts of Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 3,0:17:14.26,0:17:20.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(983,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,645)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Outskirts of Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I? My house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sleep well who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm no Chaka i grow\Ntangerines here want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right you're the one that hit me on\Nthe head just when i was gonna save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had actually gone\Nthrough with attacking that fish
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,man You would have been killed\Nfor sure stupid outsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd figure a kid from here\Nwould already know better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would make a child\Ndo something so reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a question I'd\Nreally like an answer for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I know, but they killed my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fishmen destroyed our\Ntown, killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to make them pay for\Nwhat they did, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I went to Arlong Park by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this girl stopped me from going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like an evil witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this, I\Nhave to avenge my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're truly prepared to die, then go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you had better understand, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stopped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this witch you hate kept you\Nfrom carrying out your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, you've cheated death twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just finish your tea and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're being a little\Nrough on him, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he wants to kill\Nhimself, then so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have what it\Ntakes to suffer for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suffer as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Revenge is not an easy\Npath for one to carve out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to die just because you're too foolish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for patience is nothing\Nbut a coward's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the way I feel, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a chick with tattoos,\Nyou're actually really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time you told me why you\Ndecided to come here to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a girl named Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a part of the Arlong crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It certainly looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody here knows that cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets better, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cow is my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, technically, she's my adopted\Nsister since we were both orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a sister's a sister,\Nyou know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Nami's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were raised together in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the closest thing to family I\Nhave left since our foster mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three of us used to be so happy\Ntogether in Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're telling me that Nami\Nbetrayed her mother, her sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and her whole village just to\Nbe a part of Arlong's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:21:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real witch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Nami is a total witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had us completely\Nfooled the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think she was just after\Nthe treasure for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after she risked her\Nlife to save my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She seemed so happy with us. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came here to try to convince\Nher to come back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess now that's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that\Na shipmate of mine was
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken prisoner by the\Nfishman before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's at least not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a prisoner on board this vessel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time, what was your purpose\Nin coming here to this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, I'm looking\Nfor a girl, you half-fish bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.63,0:22:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for someone I consider a good meal\NYou are either really stupid or
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got a lot of guts in there\NWe fishmen are simply the next rung
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up the evolutionary ladder from you\Npathetic humans We are incredibly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resilient We can breathe both on\Nland and underwater An ability which
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clearly establishes our physical\Nsuperiority over you I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if this will make any sense to that\Npuny brain rolling around in your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head! But fishmen are the lords of\Nall creatures. And to fight against
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us is to defy nature I'm really sick\Nof listening to your big ideas, Arlong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so serious, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that I wasn't talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a very special human,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:23:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our greatest navigator, and\Na valued member of this crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what you will, but I'm a\Nlot smarter than any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he call you his navigator, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't honestly expect me\Nto believe you work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, is this guy a\Nfriend of yours, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.70,0:23:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just another fool\Nwho thought I wasn't gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,steal all of his treasure\Nright out from under his nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.40,0:23:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think he actually followed\Nme here without knowing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shows how stupid he is. So this is\Nthe person you really are, all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you couldn't stand\Npirates you thought wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all an act and\Nyou bought the whole show
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate, plain and simple,\Nand a navigator for Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:24:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had you guys completely fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.16,0:24:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.60,0:24:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cold-blooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She betrayed her family for money,\Nso you really shouldn't feel too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I would just admit defeat\Nand try to forget the day you met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.24,0:24:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I never saw anything in her\Nto be trusted in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.58,0:24:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she turned out to be a serial\Nkiller, I wouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.38,0:24:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, then why don't you just\Nget the hell out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.66,0:24:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, anybody know why that\Nguy just jumped in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like he was just\Ntrying to get away from Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.70,0:24:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.61,0:24:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can be really mean sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.26,0:24:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying to escape any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms and legs tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, that looked a lot\Nmore like a suicide attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.30,0:24:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.52,0:25:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back. She saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.66,0:25:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.20,0:25:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really just a nice girl\Nwho can't watch one guy die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you quit\Npretending and you might
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.16,0:25:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to jump my little Cricket next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.80,0:25:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.71,0:25:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try that again and I'll make sure you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.16,0:25:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I forgot my shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.18,0:25:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grabbed these to cover up so\Nyou wouldn't get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.52,0:26:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we do with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.42,0:26:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.74,0:26:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.81,0:26:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.54,0:26:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.54,0:26:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, spit it out. What is it? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy didn't come here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.32,0:26:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was another long-nosed, weird-looking\Nguy with him, but he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left me for dead\Nand got spotted anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.36,0:26:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he escaped into Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have two reasons to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.38,0:26:48.04,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 3,0:26:45.38,0:26:48.04,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,635)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Cocoyashi Village
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.94,0:26:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.42,0:26:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.86,0:26:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just paid him this\Nmonth's tribute, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably about my\Nweapons cache they found.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.62,0:26:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.68,0:27:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.59,0:27:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the fool who thought he\Ncould hoard weapons on my island?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.50,0:27:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me. I'm a collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a new law that forbids us\Nfrom having hobbies now as well?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:19.78,0:27:24.12,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,478)\an2\bord4.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,640)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\t(3862,3904,\1a&HFF&)}{Genzo\NCocoyashi Villager-OG}Genzo\NCocoyashi Village{PP}
Dialogue: 3,0:27:19.78,0:27:24.12,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,478)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,640)\c&HFAF9FA&\4a&HFF&}{Genzo\NCocoyashi Villager-OG}Genzo\NCocoyashi Village{PP}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.74,0:27:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next you'll be telling us that we can't
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,read books or play with\Nour children anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.52,0:27:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, hobbies are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be weapons that I have forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make it difficult for me\Nand my men to keep the peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.04,0:27:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.12,0:27:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lung's gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even human!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, he's a fish man. For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.58,0:27:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for 20 towns and\Nvillages, including this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as your leader, I cannot tolerate\Neven a little rebelliousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.98,0:27:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiping out Gosa was just\Na small example of what
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:28:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can happen when you do\Nnot do as you are told.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.18,0:28:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tribute money must be paid no\Nmatter what. What? Tribute money?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.46,0:28:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just what it sounds like, money\Nwe pay him so we can stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.30,0:28:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adults and children, if there is\Neven a single person who can't pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.46,0:28:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what happened to Gosa will happen\Nto everyone in this village as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our town and the people in it\Nwill be wiped from existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He destroyed an entire\Ntown because of one person?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how Arlong rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.98,0:28:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To them we're nothing but a subspecies,\Nso killing us has always been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.50,0:28:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pathetic humans need to stop\Nwith all this thinking you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your greatest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.50,0:28:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allowing you to\Ncontribute to greatness here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.10,0:28:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, Fistman will conquer the humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.14,0:28:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and your tributes will be a small part of
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.76,0:28:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the beginning of the\Nglorious Arlong Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.26,0:29:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're planning on taking\Nover the entire East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arlong's gonna be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began to wonder what could be\Nthe reason it's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.52,0:30:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.02,0:30:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be, because\Nthey're everything I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.88,0:30:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass these arms around my dreams\Nand pull up back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way!

